    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own story \u2014 manage your party and fortress, explore, craft, forge alliances or become the enemy they fear.<br><br><strong>Shards of the Realm</strong> is a complex old-school <strong><u>Strategy/Tactical RPG</u></strong>, inspired by the classic X-Com series. It features a living open world and a wide range of deeply interconnected mechanics across both tactical and strategic layers, with <strong>over 50 hours</strong> of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your stronghold, manage workers, trade, build \u2014 everything demands smart strategic planning. On the battlefield, a flexible class system, multiclassing, skill synergies, and destructible environments allow for a wide variety of tactical approaches. A deep research and crafting system lets you prepare your squad for any challenge the world throws at you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical combat \u2014 physics, positioning, destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/665227107e086e524829832a2f2a5208.poster.avif?t=1754714516\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/665227107e086e524829832a2f2a5208.webm?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/665227107e086e524829832a2f2a5208.mp4?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>No dice rolls or abstractions \u2014 real projectiles and physical collisions drive the combat. Positioning, cover, and interaction between units are crucial.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No grid</strong> and no fixed number of actions \u2014 action points are your only limit. Spend them however you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anything can be used as cover</strong>: terrain, trees, even allies or enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Directional armor zones</strong> (front, flanks, rear) reward clever flanking and ambushes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>environment is destructible</strong> \u2014 blow up cover or open new paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friendly fire</strong> is enabled \u2014 even melee attacks can harm allies if you're reckless.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your team \u2014 no templates, just your tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/1eb34920899027afd4b25144923e7a46.poster.avif?t=1754714516\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/1eb34920899027afd4b25144923e7a46.webm?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/1eb34920899027afd4b25144923e7a46.mp4?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad of <strong>up to 9</strong> fully controllable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 base classes and 8 unique subclasses with <strong>distinct playstyle</strong>, roles and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiclassing</strong> support and a skill tree with 60+ active and passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep status effects system with differenct auras, buffs, debuffs, synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No &quot;correct&quot; builds \u2014 design your heroes your way: classic tank/DPS/support setups or hybrid roles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic depth \u2014 your stronghold, your rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/907c37f00e73af276d22df70b24d9900.poster.avif?t=1754714516\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/907c37f00e73af276d22df70b24d9900.webm?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/907c37f00e73af276d22df70b24d9900.mp4?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no loot rain \u2014 nearly all gear is hand-crafted via research and production.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your fortress</strong> is the core of your economy, science, recruitment, and crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>200 v</strong>arious<strong> items</strong> such as weapons, armors, tools, rings, trading goods to develop and produce</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>People are your main resource</strong> \u2014 who goes to the lab, who to the forge, who to the battlefield?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six NPC factions with their own goals and rivalries. Your choices shape the political map \u2014 trade, ally, or wipe them out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-night cycle</strong> affects visibility on both global and tactical levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden <strong>dungeons</strong> with unique rewards and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demonic Sieges</strong> \u2014 a global threat and a tactical opportunity. They can destroy your stronghold or help you eliminate a rival</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/1dd7fe0669143bbc80ee91b5c1cfb669.poster.avif?t=1754714516\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/1dd7fe0669143bbc80ee91b5c1cfb669.webm?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/1dd7fe0669143bbc80ee91b5c1cfb669.mp4?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shards of the Realm</strong> is a game where one mistake can cost you everything.<br>But if you enjoy meaningful decisions, deep mechanics, and a world that reacts to your choices \u2014 this is the game for you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own story \u2014 manage your party and fortress, explore, craft, forge alliances or become the enemy they fear.<br><br><strong>Shards of the Realm</strong> is a complex old-school <strong><u>Strategy/Tactical RPG</u></strong>, inspired by the classic X-Com series. It features a living open world and a wide range of deeply interconnected mechanics across both tactical and strategic layers, with <strong>over 50 hours</strong> of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your stronghold, manage workers, trade, build \u2014 everything demands smart strategic planning. On the battlefield, a flexible class system, multiclassing, skill synergies, and destructible environments allow for a wide variety of tactical approaches. A deep research and crafting system lets you prepare your squad for any challenge the world throws at you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical combat \u2014 physics, positioning, destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/665227107e086e524829832a2f2a5208.poster.avif?t=1754714516\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/665227107e086e524829832a2f2a5208.webm?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/665227107e086e524829832a2f2a5208.mp4?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>No dice rolls or abstractions \u2014 real projectiles and physical collisions drive the combat. Positioning, cover, and interaction between units are crucial.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No grid</strong> and no fixed number of actions \u2014 action points are your only limit. Spend them however you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anything can be used as cover</strong>: terrain, trees, even allies or enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Directional armor zones</strong> (front, flanks, rear) reward clever flanking and ambushes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>environment is destructible</strong> \u2014 blow up cover or open new paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friendly fire</strong> is enabled \u2014 even melee attacks can harm allies if you're reckless.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your team \u2014 no templates, just your tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/1eb34920899027afd4b25144923e7a46.poster.avif?t=1754714516\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/1eb34920899027afd4b25144923e7a46.webm?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/1eb34920899027afd4b25144923e7a46.mp4?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad of <strong>up to 9</strong> fully controllable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 base classes and 8 unique subclasses with <strong>distinct playstyle</strong>, roles and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiclassing</strong> support and a skill tree with 60+ active and passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep status effects system with differenct auras, buffs, debuffs, synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No &quot;correct&quot; builds \u2014 design your heroes your way: classic tank/DPS/support setups or hybrid roles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic depth \u2014 your stronghold, your rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/907c37f00e73af276d22df70b24d9900.poster.avif?t=1754714516\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/907c37f00e73af276d22df70b24d9900.webm?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/907c37f00e73af276d22df70b24d9900.mp4?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no loot rain \u2014 nearly all gear is hand-crafted via research and production.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your fortress</strong> is the core of your economy, science, recruitment, and crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>200 v</strong>arious<strong> items</strong> such as weapons, armors, tools, rings, trading goods to develop and produce</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>People are your main resource</strong> \u2014 who goes to the lab, who to the forge, who to the battlefield?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six NPC factions with their own goals and rivalries. Your choices shape the political map \u2014 trade, ally, or wipe them out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-night cycle</strong> affects visibility on both global and tactical levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden <strong>dungeons</strong> with unique rewards and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demonic Sieges</strong> \u2014 a global threat and a tactical opportunity. They can destroy your stronghold or help you eliminate a rival</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/1dd7fe0669143bbc80ee91b5c1cfb669.poster.avif?t=1754714516\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/1dd7fe0669143bbc80ee91b5c1cfb669.webm?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214790/extras/1dd7fe0669143bbc80ee91b5c1cfb669.mp4?t=1754714516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shards of the Realm</strong> is a game where one mistake can cost you everything.<br>But if you enjoy meaningful decisions, deep mechanics, and a world that reacts to your choices \u2014 this is the game for you.</p>",
